@host = http://localhost:5080

### Seed product detail
GET {{host}}/api/products/by-slug/apple-iphone-14-pro-256-gb

### IDs for product creation
GET {{host}}/api/categories

###
GET {{host}}/api/brands

###
GET {{host}}/api/attributes

### Use IDs returned above (seed IDs are not assumed)
@categoryId = 2
@brandId = 1
@ramId = 1
@storageId = 2
@processorId = 6

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "brandId": {{brandId}},
  "name": "Örnek Telefon",
  "attributes": [
    { "attributeDefinitionId": {{ramId}}, "numericValue": 8 },
    { "attributeDefinitionId": {{storageId}}, "numericValue": 256 },
    { "attributeDefinitionId": {{processorId}}, "textValue": "Örnek işlemci" }
  ]
}

### Pagination
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20

### Reindex PostgreSQL products into Elasticsearch
POST {{host}}/api/admin/search/reindex

### Basic Elasticsearch search
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=iphone%2015&page=1&pageSize=20

### Suggestions (active products, maximum 10)
GET {{host}}/api/search/suggestions?q=iph

### Filtered search with metadata-driven facets (repeated brandIds)
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=iphone&categoryId={{categoryId}}&brandIds={{brandId}}&filters[ram]=8&filters[storage]=256&filters[has_5g]=true

### Explicit migration: configured physical target must be empty and not active
# Already completed for products_v2; use normal reindex on an active index.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/search/migrate-index
